### Input

The input to the assistant is the path of archive and the output is the path where the code will be extracted to.

### Output

The output will be the extracted code in Java. You can see an example input and output on [this](https://github.com/TonyLing/Code-E-Extract-Assistant/tree/master/example) folder.

