we know that a user error has happened. So we know that the user will not get a valid result.

This is the same situation that happens when a user enters `SELECT * FROM users; DROP TABLE users` into
the SQL editor of some online SQL database.

The solution is to find a way to make sure that the user cannot enter this input.
We can for example use the SQL keyword `UNION` to block this input.

