### Non-Printable Characters

In the [HTML document](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_XML_and_HTML_character_entity_references) you can find some characters that are not printable. You can escape these characters in XML with `&lt` and `&gt`.

### XML Symbols

The [XML character entity reference](https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-sc-ents) specifies the following symbols:

- amp: `&amp;`
- apos: `&apos;`
- quot: `&quot;`
- lt: `&lt;`
- gt: `&gt;`

