# JaS-Code

This is a Java compiler for CodeRunner.

## Installation

```sh
cd ja-s-code/
./gradlew install
```

## Usage

```sh
./ja-s-code/com.code-runner.ja-s.main.JaS
```

## Options

| Option | Description |
| ------ | ----------- |
| `-t`   | Test        |

## Test

```sh
cd ja-s-code/
./gradlew test
```

## Contributing

Pull requests are welcome. For major changes, please open an issue first to discuss what you would like to change.

Please make sure to update tests as appropriate.
