## Overview

This is an Android application for a mobile game. In order to make the game itself, I used the Android Studio application and
the Android SDK. I used java for the code. The game is a simple game where my character can move around on a grid and can collect
diamonds. Once he has collected all diamonds the game finishes successfully. 

## About the project

One of the projects I did as part of the udemy courses I listed above. To practice some of the Java coding. I also took a look at some of the java coding principles.

## My experience

The biggest challenge I faced was when I had to make the game finish successfully and go to the next level. I had to make the level
loop. 

